; Waveform expect tests: let%expect_test blocks that print Hardcaml_waveterm
; waveforms of the processor in Cyclesim (../README.md). `dune test` runs them;
; after an intended behaviour change, review the diff and accept it with
; `dune promote`.
;
; (optional): in a switch without the test packages of scripts/opam-deps.txt
; (hardcaml_waveterm, ppx_jane, ppx_hardcaml) dune skips this library and the
; other tests still run. CI installs them and checks that they are present.

(library
 (name protocol_processor_expect)
 (libraries protocol_processor hardcaml hardcaml_waveterm base stdio yojson)
 (optional)
 (inline_tests)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_jane ppx_hardcaml)))
